{
  "title": "log10x Overview",
  "description": "## log10x\n\nWhat the 10x Engine read, what it forwarded, and what it holds in offload storage, per message pattern.\n\nMetrics arrive through the log10x Agent check, which reads the engine's Prometheus endpoint.",
  "widgets": [
    {
      "id": 1000000000000001,
      "definition": {
        "type": "image",
        "url": "https://static.datadoghq.com/static/images/logos/log10x_large.svg",
        "sizing": "contain",
        "margin": "md",
        "has_background": false,
        "has_border": false,
        "vertical_align": "center",
        "horizontal_align": "center"
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "width": 3,
        "height": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1000000000000002,
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "**About**\n\nThe 10x Engine runs in the operator's network in front of Datadog, groups events by message pattern, and decides per pattern whether to forward, compact or offload them. This dashboard shows the counts on each side of that decision.",
        "background_color": "white",
        "font_size": "14",
        "text_align": "center",
        "vertical_align": "center",
        "show_tick": false,
        "tick_pos": "50%",
        "tick_edge": "left",
        "has_padding": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 3,
        "y": 0,
        "width": 9,
        "height": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1000000000000010,
      "definition": {
        "title": "Read against forwarded",
        "background_color": "vivid_blue",
        "show_title": true,
        "type": "group",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "id": 1000000000000011,
            "definition": {
              "type": "note",
              "content": "Everything the pipeline read, against what it forwarded downstream. The gap is what the per-pattern decisions removed from the stream to Datadog.",
              "background_color": "blue",
              "font_size": "14",
              "text_align": "center",
              "vertical_align": "center",
              "show_tick": false,
              "tick_pos": "50%",
              "tick_edge": "left",
              "has_padding": true
            },
            "layout": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 0,
              "width": 12,
              "height": 1
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 1000000000000012,
            "definition": {
              "title": "Bytes read and bytes forwarded",
              "title_size": "16",
              "title_align": "left",
              "show_legend": true,
              "legend_layout": "auto",
              "legend_columns": [
                "avg",
                "min",
                "max",
                "value",
                "sum"
              ],
              "type": "timeseries",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "query1"
                    },
                    {
                      "formula": "query2"
                    }
                  ],
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "query1",
                      "query": "sum:log10x.bytes.read.count{$tenx_env,$tenx_user_service}.as_count()"
                    },
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "query2",
                      "query": "sum:log10x.bytes.forwarded.count{$tenx_env,$tenx_user_service}.as_count()"
                    }
                  ],
                  "response_format": "timeseries",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "dog_classic",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  },
                  "display_type": "line"
                }
              ]
            },
            "layout": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 1,
              "width": 6,
              "height": 3
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 1000000000000013,
            "definition": {
              "title": "Events read and events forwarded",
              "title_size": "16",
              "title_align": "left",
              "show_legend": true,
              "legend_layout": "auto",
              "legend_columns": [
                "avg",
                "min",
                "max",
                "value",
                "sum"
